Lemma uv_over : forall s E' x, uv (CC.env_over GT.NF s E') x = uv E' (CC.esubstL GT.NF s x).
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S50!1,2|600;!1+10!3'jU'f:#3#2!2'`G2#1!3'k<'f:#3#1$s;R'j=$E';R+`=$x;R+`?vd!6'^O13$b;R1!3+5+A!2'F0!2'`G!3'jU'f:#4#3#2!2'F0#1!2,O+A!2'F03!2'`G#24!4'k='f:#3#2#1!3+5+A!2'`D2#1!2'`D#24").
Qed.
